# THE FACE SETTLEMENT (src/content/interiors/face_hold.gd): the middens' people
# living in the walls at a junction, behind a mouth shored with salvage.
#
#   tools/tour.sh tours/face-hold.tour --seed=1 --hour=11 --weather=clear:0 --give=record:1
#
# 01 is the mouth in the junction's wall, 01b over the shoulder at it. 02 is the settlement from above: the
# sort with its long table and brazier, the cells and the words room cut behind
# it, the lookout at the front corner. 03 is over the shoulder down the sort, 03b
# the day's sort read off its table (StoryRooms, desk:the_sort). 04
# is up the lookout's ladder by the jump key, at the slit (`above`). 05 is the
# reader at home by their desk, over the shoulder in a cell three tiles across,
# where the eye comes over the head (Shoulder.fallback; 21_doors DWELLER). 06 is the reader taking the record and
# giving the string (the deed), and 07, back out in the slot, the map with
# the way up the string is laid along.
coast calm
near door:face_hold
await door 5
wait 0.6
shot 01-the-mouth-in-the-wall with door,land:the_middens
hold shoulder_peek
await shoulder 3
wait 1.0
shot 01b-the-mouth-over-the-shoulder with door,shoulder
release shoulder_peek
wait 0.6
press use 0.1
await inside:face_hold 20
wait 1.0
shot 02-the-settlement with inside:face_hold
hold shoulder_peek
await shoulder 3
wait 1.0
shot 03-down-the-sort with inside:face_hold,shoulder
release shoulder_peek
near thing:sort_table
wait 0.6
press use
await reading 3
wait 0.4
shot 03b-reading-the-sort-table with reading,inside:face_hold
press pause
wait 0.5
near ladder
wait 0.6
press jump 0.1
wait 2.0
shot 04-at-the-lookout with inside:face_hold,above
near dweller
wait 1.0
hold shoulder_peek
await shoulder 3
wait 1.0
shot 05-the-reader-at-home with inside:face_hold,shoulder
release shoulder_peek
wait 0.6
press use
await talking 3
wait 0.4
shot 06-the-reader-gives-the-string with talking,inside:face_hold
press pause
wait 0.5
near door
await door 10
press use 0.1
await outside 30
wait 1.0
tap map
await app:map 3
wait 0.6
shot 07-the-way-up-on-the-map with app:map,outside
tap map
await app:none 3
